{"1376580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alien Dawn", "steam_appid": 1376580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you buy into the game now, you’ll be playing the latest version of our Playtest Alpha.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What You’re Playing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>vertical slice of the game</strong> — one complete <strong>Escape Mode mission</strong> designed to showcase the core gameplay, VR interaction, combat, exploration, and survival systems currently in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission can be replayed with <strong>procedurally placed Points of Interest</strong>, giving each run some variation as you explore, fight, scavenge, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an actively developed playtest build. <strong>As development continues, the existing mission will be refined and additional missions will be added at a later date.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VR Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highly optimized open world</strong> delivering PCVR-quality graphics with scalable settings for a wide range of PCVR hardware</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical, weighty gripping system</strong> designed specifically for VR</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive open world</strong> where most objects can be picked up, climbed on, or destroyed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manual reloading</strong>, armor plate insertion, and revive injectors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Body IK</strong> with physical hands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seated and Standing modes</strong> with adjustable height offsets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive sound design</strong> with hundreds of unique sound effects for physical interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strong haptic feedback</strong> for important player interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer co-op for 4+ players</strong>, with cross-play between VR and Flat-screen Desktop players</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Playtest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an opportunity to play the game while it is still being actively developed and help shape where it goes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you'd like to be involved and provide feedback directly, you're welcome to <strong>join the Discord using the link on this page or participate through the Steam forums.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you buy into the game now, you’ll be playing the latest version of our Playtest Alpha.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What You’re Playing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>vertical slice of the game</strong> — one complete <strong>Escape Mode mission</strong> designed to showcase the core gameplay, VR interaction, combat, exploration, and survival systems currently in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission can be replayed with <strong>procedurally placed Points of Interest</strong>, giving each run some variation as you explore, fight, scavenge, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an actively developed playtest build. <strong>As development continues, the existing mission will be refined and additional missions will be added at a later date.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VR Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highly optimized open world</strong> delivering PCVR-quality graphics with scalable settings for a wide range of PCVR hardware</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical, weighty gripping system</strong> designed specifically for VR</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive open world</strong> where most objects can be picked up, climbed on, or destroyed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manual reloading</strong>, armor plate insertion, and revive injectors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Body IK</strong> with physical hands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seated and Standing modes</strong> with adjustable height offsets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive sound design</strong> with hundreds of unique sound effects for physical interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strong haptic feedback</strong> for important player interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer co-op for 4+ players</strong>, with cross-play between VR and Flat-screen Desktop players</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Playtest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an opportunity to play the game while it is still being actively developed and help shape where it goes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you'd like to be involved and provide feedback directly, you're welcome to <strong>join the Discord using the link on this page or participate through the Steam forums.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Built from the ground up for PCVR, this action survival game combines detailed visuals, realistic physics, and a handcrafted, interactive, and destructible open world. Explore, fight, scavenge, and survive solo or in co-op with Flatscreen cross-play and the VR features players expect.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376580/header.jpg?t=1786405021", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376580/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786405021", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376580/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786405021", "website": "http://www.xtian.tv/", "pc_